{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35427","headline":"穆王宴王母於九光流霞馆 · 曹唐","name":"穆王宴王母於九光流霞馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑叶扶疎闭日华，穆王邀命宴流霞。\n霓旌着地云初驻，金奏掀天月欲斜。\n歌咽细风吹粉蕊，饮余清露湿瑶砂。\n不知白马红缰解，偷吃东田碧玉花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}